      "writtenOn": "2019-10-24T20:38:24Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The no-op change was actually implemented in Telephony, and may actually have effect in P as well depending on the device.\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/frameworks/opt/telephony/+/master/src/java/com/android/internal/telephony/RIL.java#4041. This was done because the HAL 1.2 was optional for reasons I don\u0027t want to delve into. We *could* also add a check for Q since HAL 1.4 was mandated.\n\nStarting in HAL 1.2 these indications are provided as unsolicited messages generated by the modem based on pre-defined criteria (that are not currently configurable by apps, but it\u0027s under consideration).\nhttps://android.googlesource.com/platform/hardware/interfaces/+/refs/heads/master/radio/1.2/IRadio.hal#118",
